{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17456","headline":"广陵诗 · 权德舆","name":"广陵诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"广陵实佳丽，隋季此爲京。\n八方称辐凑，五达如砥平。\n大斾映空色，笳箫发连营。\n层台出重霄，金碧摩颢清。\n交驰流水毂，迥接浮云甍。\n青楼旭日映，绿野春风晴。\n喷玉光照地，颦蛾价倾城。\n灯前互巧笑，陌上相逢迎。\n飘飘翠羽薄，掩映红襦明。\n兰麝远不散，管弦闲自清。\n曲士守文墨，达人随性情。\n茫茫竟同尽，冉冉将何营。\n且申今日欢，莫务身後名。\n肯学诸儒辈，书窗误一生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}